    "value": "∀ {X : Type} {C : ConceptClass X Bool} {history : List (X × Bool)} {x : X} {c : X → Bool},\n  c ∈ versionSpace C history →\n    (SOA X C).predict history x ≠ c x →\n      LittlestoneDim X (versionSpace C history) < ⊤ →\n        LittlestoneDim X (versionSpace C (history ++ [(x, c x)])) < LittlestoneDim X (versionSpace C history)"
