    "value": "When Ldim(V) = 0 (↑↑0), all concepts in V agree on every point. Key lemma for M-VersionSpaceCollapse."
  },
  {
    "field": "argument_node.pretty",
    "value": "∀ {X : Type} {V : ConceptClass X Bool},\n  LittlestoneDim X V = ↑0 → Set.Nonempty V → ∀ (x : X) (c₁ c₂ : X → Bool), c₁ ∈ V → c₂ ∈ V → c₁ x = c₂ x"
