  {
    "field": "argument_node.doc",
    "value": "Build a tree of depth k+1 from shattered subtrees on both sides. Parametrized over b : Bool so we don't need to case-split in the caller."
  },
  {
    "field": "argument_node.pretty",
    "value": "∀ {X : Type} {V : ConceptClass X Bool} {x : X} {k : ℕ} {b : Bool},\n  (∃ Tb, LTree.isShattered {c | c ∈ V ∧ c x = b} Tb) →\n    (∃ Tnb, LTree.isShattered {c | c ∈ V ∧ c x = !b} Tnb) →\n      (∃ c ∈ V, c x = b) → (∃ c ∈ V, c x = !b) → LittlestoneDim X V ≥ ↑↑(k + 1)"
